  "_about": "Active Effects authored for SW5E powers that shipped without any (2026-10-03). Keyed by power name. `on` = which activity type carries the effect (save → lands on a failed save; utility/heal → buff; damage → manual apply tray). Change patterns mirror dnd5e's own Player's Handbook spells (Bless, Haste, Slow, Shield, Hold Person, Suggestion, Eyebite). `marker` effects carry no mechanics: they track duration/concentration and remind the table of a rule dnd5e can't express natively.",
